
## Authentication Layer

Used during **login / API auth middleware**.

1. `session:{sessionId}`
2. `rate_limit:{userId}:{endpoint}:{minute}`
3. `login_attempts:{ip}:{hour}`

Integration:

```text
Auth API
 ├─ login
 ├─ middleware verify session
 └─ rate limiter
```

